>probably the best way to go is a blessed scroll of remove curse.
>Blessed scrolls of remove curse uncurses all the items you are carrying, not
>just the ones you are wearing.

But, I believe the number of items uncursed is random.

To bless a number of items that are group together under the
same letter in your inventory ( ie L - 3 scrolls of blank paper),
w)ield them, then #dip into holy water.  In this way only one 
bottle of holy water will be used for all items being blessed.

Note: sometimes you need to drop the items a repick them up to 
get them to group properly.  If they don't group as wished then 
the seemly similar item are different in some other respect...
namely cursed/uncursed/blessed.  For example, if you have the 
following inventory:
   z - 2 scrolls of blank paper
   A - scroll of blank paper
Then d)rop A, pick it, and your new inventory looks the same:
   z - 2 scrolls of blank paper
   A - scroll of blank paper.
then you could safely guess that items z) and A) are not identically 
then same.  Consult your local alter for cursed/blessed identification.


